zoning lot containing commercial uses by the applicable district regulations. However, for the districts in which the allowable floor area ratio, as set forth in paragraphs (b) or (c) of Section 24-111 exceeds the amount permitted for a zoning lot containing commercial uses, the provisions of paragraph (b) or (c) of Section 24-111, as applicable, shall be used to compute the maximum floor area permissible for the zoning lot unless modified pursuant to Section 74-903.","ordinal":15}],"tables":[{"id":"zr-17724-table-001","ordinal":0,"sourceAnchor":null,"caption":null,"plainText":"Districts Maximum Floor Area Ratio C3 1.00 C4-1 C7-1 2.00 C8-1 2.40 C4-2A C4-3A C7-2 3.00 C1-6A C2-6A C4-4A C4-4L C4-5A C7-3 4.00 C4-5D 4.20 C4-2 C4-3 C8-2 4.80 C4-5X C7-4 5.00 C6-1A 6.00 C1-6 C1-7 C2-6 C4-2F C4-4 C4-4D C4-5 C4-8 C6-1 C6-2 C7-5 C8-3 C8-4 6.50 C1-8A C2-7A C6-3A 7.50 C7-6 8.00 C1-8X C2-7X C6-3D C6-3X 9.00 C1-8 C1-9 C2-7 C2-8 C4-6 C4-7 C4-9 C5-1 C5-2 C5-4 C6-3 C6-4 C6-5 C6-8 C7-7 10.00 C4-11 C6-11 C7-8 12.00 C4-12 C5-3 C5-5 C6-6 C6-7 C6-9 C6-12 C7-9 15.00","contentHash":"e04c93cee6253d1060ce6035443633210f27f088756f6e153470955266466d8c"}],"mapReferences":[],"appendixReferences":[],"specialDistrict":null,"amendmentHistory":[{"effectiveDate":"2024-12-05","reportNumber":"N240290ZRY","reportURL":"http://a030-cpc.nyc.gov/html/cpc/report.aspx?num=N%20240290%20ZRY","projectName":"City of Yes for Housing Opportunity","action":"Amended","notes":"Added new C4-6, C4-9, C4-11, C4-12, C6-11 and C6-12 district applicability","description":"An amendment modifying multiple Sections to expand opportunities for housing within all zoning districts, and across all 59 of the City’s Community Districts"},{"effectiveDate":"2024-06-06","reportNumber":"N240010ZRY","reportURL":"http://a030-cpc.nyc.gov/html/cpc/report.aspx?num=N%20240010%20ZRY","projectName":"City of Yes for Economic Opportunity","action":"Amended","notes":"Added applicability to range of C7 Districts to table.","description":"An amendment